'''Brangar's Folly''', formerly known as '''Brangar's Farmstead''', is an abandoned farm located in the northeastern [[Grim Reaches]]. The farm was owned by [[Brangar]], who was once the richest farmer in all the Grim Reaches. However, when the [[Dragonmaw clan]] came, he refused to leave and said that he would die before giving up his land - which he did. After his death, no one claimed the grain that had remained in his granaries.<ref name="Brangar's Folly">{{questlong|Alliance|36|Brangar's Folly (quest)|Brangar's Folly}}</ref>

However, there were whispers that Brangar went mad in the last days he was hiding something darker,<ref name="Brangar's Folly" /> and in his personal journal he wrote that he was hearing voices that compelled him to ignore the magistrates' call to evacuate.<ref>{{questlong|Alliance|36|Brangar's Journal (quest)|Brangar's Journal}}</ref> The corruption that seeps through the Grim Reaches has taken root within the farmstead, which has manifested as [[Repugnant Ooze]]s that plague the land and are concentrated upon the farmstead in particular.<ref>{{questlong|Horde|37|Signs of Corruption}}</ref>

